      <ul>
        <li>— for volumetric- or mass-flow metering available for pipe sizes DN25 to DN150 (1 to 6 in.).</li>
        <li>— problems caused by impulse piping eliminated by mounting the transmitter and manifold directly on to the meter complete with manifold and ABB DP or Multivariable transmitter.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Corrosion and erosion resistant</strong></p>
      <ul>
        <li>— V-shaped restriction eliminates damage from the secondary phase</li>
        <li>— no critical surface dimensions to wear and affect performance</li>
        <li>— durable with excellent long term stability</li>
