          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>— body: carbon steel, 316 stainless steel</td>
            <td>— restriction: carbon steel, 316 stainless steel</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Mounting hardware</strong></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>— 3 - or 5-valve manifold: 316 stainless steel with PTFE packing</td>
            <td>— Impulse lines / fittings: 316 stainless steel</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Accuracy</strong></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Calibrated</td>
            <td>±0.5 % of actual flow when operated within the calibrated range</td>
